    github.com/zalando/go-keyring/internal/shellescape
                                          MIT
                                          Copyright (c) 2016 Alessio Treglia
                                          (vendored inside go-keyring, and so
                                          carrying its own licence)
    github.com/godbus/dbus/v5             BSD-2-Clause
